  <h1 class="page-title">Request information or access to the central hub for Regulatory Notifications (ex eGate)</h1>




            <div id="block-eba-theme-content">
  
    
      <form class="webform-submission-form webform-submission-add-form webform-submission-press-enquiry-form-form webform-submission-press-enquiry-form-add-form js-webform-details-toggle webform-details-toggle" data-drupal-selector="webform-submission-press-enquiry-form-add-form" action="/form/regulatory-notifications" method="post" id="webform-submission-press-enquiry-form-add-form" accept-charset="UTF-8">
  
  <div id="edit-processed-text" class="js-form-item form-item js-form-type-processed-text form-type-processed-text js-form-item- form-item- form-no-label">
        <p>A new Extranet page for <strong>Regulatory Notifications</strong> has been created and will serve as the <strong>central hub for all future submissions</strong>. The Extranet environment provides clear instructions, dedicated submission channels, and access points for each notification type, <strong>replacing the former eGate workflows.</strong></p><p>The <strong>eGate platform has been decommissioned on 31 March 2026.&nbsp;</strong></p><p>This decision follows the significant reduction in notifications processed via eGate in recent years and forms part of the EBA’s broader efforts to <strong>streamline and modernise the submission process for regulatory notifications</strong>.</p><p>Competent authorities can access the page here: <a href="https://ebaonline.sharepoint.com/sites/Extranet_RegulatoryNotifications/SitePages/TrainingHome.aspx?spStartSource=spappbar">EBA Extranet – Regulatory Notifications</a>.</p><p>Should you have any <strong>questions </strong>on the new procedures or require <strong>assistance</strong>, contact us using the provided <strong>webform</strong>.&nbsp;</p><p><strong>New users</strong> that do not yet have access to the EBA Extranet should require access using the same webform.&nbsp;</p>
        </div>

<div class="js-form-item form-item js-form-type-textfield form-type-textfield js-form-item-name form-item-name">
      

<label for="edit-name" class="form-label form-required">Name</label>


        
<input  data-drupal-selector="edit-name" type="text" id="edit-name" name="name" value="" size="60" maxlength="255" class="required form-element form-element--type-text form-element--api-textfield form-control" required="required" aria-required="true" />


        </div>

<div class="js-form-item form-item js-form-type-textfield form-type-textfield js-form-item-surname form-item-surname">
      

<label for="edit-surname" class="form-label form-required">Surname</label>


        
<input  data-drupal-selector="edit-surname" type="text" id="edit-surname" name="surname" value="" size="60" maxlength="255" class="required form-element form-element--type-text form-element--api-textfield form-control" required="required" aria-required="true" />


        </div>

<div class="js-form-item form-item js-form-type-textfield form-type-textfield js-form-item-job-title form-item-job-title">
      

<label for="edit-job-title" class="form-label form-required">Job title</label>


        
<input  data-drupal-selector="edit-job-title" type="text" id="edit-job-title" name="job_title" value="" size="60" maxlength="255" class="required form-element form-element--type-text form-element--api-textfield form-control" required="required" aria-required="true" />


        </div>

<div class="js-form-item form-item js-form-type-email form-type-email js-form-item-email form-item-email">
      

<label for="edit-email" class="form-label form-required">Email</label>


        
<input  data-drupal-selector="edit-email" type="email" id="edit-email" name="email" value="" size="60" maxlength="254" class="form-email required form-element form-element--type-email form-element--api-email form-control" required="required" aria-required="true" />


        </div>

<div class="js-form-item form-item js-form-type-textfield form-type-textfield js-form-item-authority form-item-authority">
      

<label for="edit-authority" class="form-label form-required">Authority</label>


        
<input  data-drupal-selector="edit-authority" type="text" id="edit-authority" name="authority" value="" size="60" maxlength="255" class="required form-element form-element--type-text form-element--api-textfield form-control" required="required" aria-required="true" />


        </div>

<div class="js-form-item form-item js-form-type-textfield form-type-textfield js-form-item-subject-of-the-request form-item-subject-of-the-request">
      

<label for="edit-subject-of-the-request" class="form-label form-required">Subject of the request</label>


        
<input  data-drupal-selector="edit-subject-of-the-request" type="text" id="edit-subject-of-the-request" name="subject_of_the_request" value="" size="60" maxlength="255" class="required form-element form-element--type-text form-element--api-textfield form-control" required="required" aria-required="true" />


        </div>

<div class="js-form-item form-item js-form-type-textarea form-type-textarea js-form-item-text-of-the-request form-item-text-of-the-request">
      

<label for="edit-text-of-the-request" class="form-label form-required">Text of the request</label>


